{
  "id": "i02-l07",
  "unit": "i02-and-then",
  "title": "What happened?",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "To retell, chain the steps with participles and keep one finite verb at the end:\n\n**বাস থেকে নেমে হেঁটে অফিসে গেলাম** 'I got off the bus and walked to the office.'\n\nEach participle is one step: **নেমে** 'having got off', **দাঁড়িয়ে** 'standing', **হেঁটে** 'walking'. Start a new sentence when the subject changes.\n\nUseful in stories: **শেষমেশ** 'in the end', **যাই হোক** 'anyway' (back to the point), **ধরলাম** 'I caught (a bus)', **নামলাম** 'I got off'. **বাস দাঁড়িয়ে ছিল** 'the bus was standing still'.",
